.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH NOHUP 1 "2026-09-01"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
nohup \- Run COMMAND ignoring hangup signals.
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBnohup\fR COMMAND [ARG]...
.br
\fBnohup\fR OPTION
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Run COMMAND ignoring hangup signals.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH EXTRA
If standard input is terminal, it\*(Aqll be replaced with /dev/null.
If standard output is terminal, it\*(Aqll be appended to nohup.out instead,
or $HOME/nohup.out, if nohup.out open failed.
If standard error is terminal, it\*(Aqll be redirected to stdout.
.SH "نسخه (VERSION)"
v(uutils coreutils) 0.11.0
